  "details": "Allow filtering world search by community labs, non community labs, or both.\n\nThis is because sometimes I want to find specifically non community labs worlds.\n\nExample use cases\n\n-Searching for a new home world\n\n-Just making the results pages more concise and easier to scroll through when looking for a nice world to visit\n\n-Narrower search if looking for a particular published world\n\nMockup idea attached but honestly it could just be a single \"include labs\" toggle since community labs alone is probably not searched often",
